  better to do it than at the tribeca film  festival where one of its founders is  goodfellas star robert de niro he will  be there as well as some other cast  members hopefully mr scorsese all in a  special q a hosted by jon stewart so  there you have it those are our five  reasons to be excited for the tribeca  film festival for fandango movie clips  i'm alicia malone bye  you
 

